= Mikhail Liber

Liber is a Bundist economist working for the RSDRP and has been a labor minister on multiple occasions. His priority is to improve conditions for organized workers.

- @labor_rights_
- @union_unity
- @jewish_workers
- @root: Return to main

@labor_rights_
title: Labor Rights
subtitle: As Labor Minister, Wissell can help set regulations for working conditions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government and labor_minister_party = "SPD"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if labor_minister_party != "SPD" : The SPD does not control the Labor Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: labor_rights


@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the Bund.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
